From 9834d59b711eb2a387997b71602a48a63fefbf10 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: STI2D OS <bff1fit@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 27 Oct 2026 03:27:02 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/4] STI2D OS: Apple Watch-like home screen for the N0120

- Band-based, anti-aliased rendering engine with Inter fonts (apps/sti2d)
- Boot animation, watch face and honeycomb home screen with fisheye lens
- Settings: date and time with time zones (Paris by default), credits
- French by default, with English, Spanish, German, Portuguese and Italian
- Round watchOS-like icons, dark theme
- WebUSB installer that flashes the custom userland and STI2D-Play

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
